// Name :
"P573283567" "From {SENDER_NAME}"
// LocationString :
"P3817773604" "Valentine"
// ProfessionString :
"P856364347" ""
// Script Variable CORRECT_DELIVERY_NAME :
"P2166597007" "Mender Tesseract"
// Script Variable CORRECT_DELIVERY_TEXT :
"P2690931153" "Hrmmm, fashion sense is still tingling, {HeroName}. Hey! Is that a B-mail? Wow! I haven't seen one of those in forever! Who sent it?<br><br><color orange>Meg Tesseract watches the message from Ramiel and an ever broadening smirk forms on her darkened lips.</color><br><br>Hello handsome! Wow, he sure knows how to tempt a Mender! I mean, no tether? Incarnate power?! Yes, please!<br><br>Besides... he's a hunk. They sure don't make them like him anytime soon."
// Script Variable WRONG_DELIVERY_NAME :
"P4170805427" "Mortimer Kal"
// Script Variable WRONG_DELIVERY_TEXT :
"P250407852" "<color orange>Mortimer Kal sneers at the hi-tech toy flittering before him and begrudgingly views the message. He then contemplates for a long minute.</color><br><br>What incarnate power could Ramiel be thinking of? Perhaps there is another path to power that I have overlooked..."
// Script Variable VALENTINE_DISCOVERY_TEXT :
"P2093678536" "A honeybee sized chrome orb flits and flutters before you on tiny scintillating carbon fiber wings which protrude from minute depressions in its reflective shell. A small flap in what you can only assume is the front snaps open and an image of Mender Ramiel appears in your mind's eye. It says:"
// Script Variable VALENTINE_TEXT :
"P3399656144" "<i>Of all the beings I have met in all my travels; past, present, future, you are the most profound, the most alluring, the most similar to myself, and yet the most mysterious. No matter how far or long I hurl myself away, my thoughts cannot help but circle you like planets around a star. Coming Storm or not, time is a fleeting thing and its value comes in enjoying it fully. I want to enjoy what time there is left with you, Tesseract. We will find Incarnate power together, and then escape our tethers, escape from time and live out eternity as far from the coming end as possible. Meet me when we said goodbye for the first time, and let us instead say hello to a future together.</i><br><br><color yellow>Interesting, it sounds like Mender Ramiel wants to cut and run away with Mender Tesseract, and has a means of gaining incarnate power for himself and his would be beau.<br><br>Perhaps that is what they need to do. For all you know, this invitation could be ancient history between the two Menders. On the other hand, if they've found a source of incarnate power, maybe Mortimer Kal would like to hear about it.</color>"
// Script Variable SENDER_NAME :
"P567688450" "Mender Ramiel"
// Script Variable VALENTINE_CLUE :
"P2493446462" "This Valentine is in the form of a tiny chrome sphere flitting around on almost invisible carbon fiber wings. It transmits a recorded message to the recipients mind's eye, allowing the message to be viewed, heard, felt, smelt, and even tasted in complete privacy. This particular message is from Mender Ramiel and intended for Mender Tesseract."
// AskAboutTextOverride :
"P3668577043" "Reconsider your options"
// ContactRequiresText :
"P3611273721" "You are of the wrong alignment to get this tip."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2659787689" "You're unsure of exactly what to do with this information"
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1255120992" "This Valentine is of no use to you."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1338064068" "You already have enough things to do."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P3623388284" "You're currently too busy to act upon this information."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P3299591369" "Failsafe"

